  "created": "2018-02-06T19:16:53.411Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey everyone! \n\nI'm having a strange issue with Spawning at the moment.  The way I have mine setup is, Spawner Object -> OnInteract -> Spawn Prefab -> Prefab set to DestroyObject (itself) after 120 seconds. And that works just fine, I spawn a bunch of objects, two minutes pass, and they start destroying. I can keep spawning them after the initial wave, but if I lets say take 5 minutes to go do something else, come back, the Spawner object still shows as being interactable but on interacting with it nothing then happens.\n\nThis seems like a bug, but if there is a better way to accomplish this sort of task I would appreciate being clued in to that, thanks for your time!\n\n- With love, The Architect",
